&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Graphic Designer who brings both creative vision and serious production muscle. You&#39;re as comfortable defining a brand&#39;s visual language as you are executing pixel-perfect assets across a dozen different formats. You&#39;ve thrived in fast-moving, highly technical environments — and you know how to make complex subject matter feel clear, compelling, and human. Experience in fintech or financial services is a strong plus: we operate in a trust-sensitive space where design rigor matters. You care about craft, move fast without cutting corners, and know how to set a bar for quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the visual execution of brand work end-to-end — from concept through final production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design across a full range of surfaces: web, mobile, social media, email, out-of-home, presentations, and print&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and evolve brand systems, including typography, color, iconography, and layout guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write copy that supports your designs — headlines, taglines, social captions, and short-form content that&#39;s on-brand and on-message&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create original illustrations that feel distinctly on-brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with marketing, product, and content teams to translate briefs into compelling visual work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and scale a design system for consistent, efficient production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of graphic design experience, with a portfolio that shows strong brand sensibility and production range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency experience. You&#39;re used to managing multiple workstreams, adapting to different briefs quickly, and delivering polished work under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, or highly technical industries (developer tools, infrastructure, data, enterprise software). You know how to make dense subject matter approachable without losing credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of Figma and the Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to work in and support brand systems, not just one-off pieces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for multiple channels simultaneously, with a clear understanding of format, spec, and context for each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong illustration skills, whether hand-drawn, vector, or a hybrid style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent typographic instincts and attention to compositional detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects, prioritize ruthlessly, and hit deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communication — you can articulate your design decisions and take feedback well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion design experience (After Effects, Lottie, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth startup or in-house brand team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
